==================================================================
Note on aimethflow-core (pre-publication phase only)
==================================================================

Steps 14, 15, and 19 of the pipeline depend on the companion package
`aimethflow-core`, which is held in a private repository pending publication
of the AIMethFlow paper in iMeta (anticipated 2026) and a corresponding
Chinese patent application. `aimethflow-core` is distributed to iMeta-assigned
peer reviewers under a separate Pre-Publication License (see the
`aimethflow-core` repository's `LICENSE` for terms).

Upon paper acceptance, `aimethflow-core` will be merged into this repository
and the merged codebase will continue to be governed by the MIT License above.
At that point this note will be retired.

The MIT grant above covers everything currently in this repository — the
stub modules at `src/scripts/modules/feature_utils.py`,
`src/scripts/modules/classifier_utils.py`, and `src/scripts/external_validate.py`
are MIT-licensed; only the real implementations they substitute for (held in
`aimethflow-core`) are governed by the separate Pre-Publication License during
peer review.
